    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49408" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύμον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], τό</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Arist.
			<u>HA</u>
			626b21
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Pr.</u>
			925a9
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Thphr.
			<u>HP</u>
			6.2.3
		</span></i>.: dual <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύμω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					167
				</span></i>
			: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					14.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				179.4
			</span></i>: gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					283
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.226.2
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Zonas</span>):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύμος</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.36
			</span></i>:— <i>Cretan thyme, Thymbra capitata</i>, ll.cc.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.54
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μύρον φάσκειν οὐδὲν τοῦ θ. ἥδιον
					ὄζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Char.</u>
					4.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> a marine
			plant, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.7.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mixture of thyme with honey and vinegar</i>, eaten by the poor
			of Attica, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				253
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				283
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				226.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Fug.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
